* {{audio|en|en-au-behind the eight-ball.ogg|a=AU}}

===Prepositional phrase===
{{en-prep phrase}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} In a [[difficult]] situation or [[tight spot]]; at a [[disadvantage]].
#: {{ux|en|After his last two projects failed, he was really '''behind the eight-ball'''.}}
#: {{ux|en|He was desperate, playing '''behind the eight-ball'''.}}

====Usage notes====
